---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactCta from '../components/ContactCta.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Salim Youssef Najim — Engineering & Writing" description="Meet Salim Youssef Najim, Aerospace Engineering student at Khalifa University, LUMOS team lead and author of Built from Physics.">
  <section class="page-hero split-hero section-pad">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow section-index">Profile</p>
      <h1>Salim<br/><span>Youssef Najim.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">Aerospace Engineering student. Author. Interested in how the world works and what we can build from it.</p>
      <dl class="page-facts">
        <div><dt>Education</dt><dd>Khalifa University</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Field</dt><dd>Aerospace Engineering</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <figure class="portrait-frame">
      <img src="/images/salim.webp" alt="Portrait of Salim Youssef Najim" width="826" height="826" fetchpriority="high"/>
      <figcaption class="eyebrow">Salim Youssef Najim</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>
  <section class="chapter-section section-pad">
    <div class="reading-intro"><p class="eyebrow section-index">Background & perspective</p><p>I’m interested in how things work, who they serve and what it takes to build them.</p></div>
    <div class="chapters">
      <article class="chapter reveal"><span class="eyebrow">01</span><div><h2>Education.</h2><p>I study Aerospace Engineering at Khalifa University. Flight, physics and complex systems form the foundation of my academic path.</p><a class="text-link" href="/aerospace/">Aerospace & technical interests <Arrow/></a></div></article>
      <article class="chapter reveal"><span class="eyebrow">02</span><div><h2>Project leadership.</h2><p>I led the team developing LUMOS, a student concept for decentralized urban lighting. The concept brought together wind generation, energy storage, a wireless transfer demonstration and light sensing around a sustainable-energy question.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects/lumos/">Read the LUMOS case study <Arrow/></a></div></article>
      <article class="chapter reveal"><span class="eyebrow">03</span><div><h2>Writing.</h2><p>My books explore the physical and digital systems around us. Built from Physics connects scientific principles to engineering. The Talk to AI Like a Pro series explores prompting, context, workflows and the practical use of AI.</p><a class="text-link" href="/books/">Explore my books <Arrow/></a></div></article>
      <article class="chapter reveal"><span class="eyebrow">04</span><div><h2>Business perspective.</h2><p>A technical idea is one part of a larger question. I’m also interested in the people it serves, the problem it addresses and the practical work of building a business around it.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ventures/">My approach to entrepreneurship <Arrow/></a></div></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <ContactCta/>
</Layout>
